stunmesh-go performs WireGuard NAT traversal by discovering each peer's
public endpoint via STUN and publishing it through a pluggable rendezvous
backend, such as the OpenDHT public DHT network. It keeps peer endpoints
up to date so WireGuard tunnels between hosts behind NAT can establish
and maintain connectivity without static port forwarding.

WWW: https://github.com/tjjh89017/stunmesh-go
